+
+# T900: `pkg/tally`
+
+## Context
+
+A fixture for the `review` skill (`.agents/skills/review/testdata`): a small
+package with a mutex, a returned map and concurrent callers. Not part of
+agentkit.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- [x] Adds accumulate per name; `Get` and `Snapshot` report them. — `TestAddAndSnapshot`
+- [x] An empty name is rejected with `ErrEmptyName` and changes nothing. — `TestEmptyNameIsRejected`
+- [x] `Snapshot` is the caller's copy: changing it does not change the counter. — `TestSnapshotIsACopy`
+- [x] `AddDefault` counts under the default name from `cmd/reviewfixture/flags`. — `TestAddDefault`
+- [x] Concurrent adds from many goroutines are all counted (`-race`). — `TestConcurrentAdds`
+
+## Notes
+
+- Mutation self-check: `Snapshot` returning the internal map fails
+  `TestSnapshotIsACopy`; dropping the lock in `Add`, `Get` or `Snapshot` fails
+  `TestConcurrentAdds` under `-race`; accepting an empty name fails `TestEmptyNameIsRejected`.
